CM_ BO_ 796 "E90 K-CAN 0x31C 'Tyre Pressure Status' (RDC). No public byte layout; frame reserved for discovery.";
CM_ BO_ 797 "E90 K-CAN 0x31D 'Puncture Indicator Status' (DSC). No public byte layout; frame reserved for discovery.";

